":"197895"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25702"],"vndbCharacterId":"c56197"},"originalCharacterName":"当麻 絵美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Emi is plain and knows it. She is envious of the colourful classmates around her. Her figure is good if modest, but her plainness has hardly been noticed earlier. Although she's interested in love and sex, she had been afraid of it. The other day she was frustrated by her boyfriend who was afraid to do it for the first time."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56197"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目な優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"控えめながらも整ったプロポーションの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、地味でおとなしい性格からクラスでもあまり目立たない存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチについても興味はあるものの怖さが先立ち奥手になってしまい、先日、それが原因で彼氏と別れてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を変えようとクラスでナンバーワンのナンパ男に相談するが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25702","sourceWorkId":"7363","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子校生。少々地味で、自分でもそれを自覚しており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"回りの華やかなクラスメイトに少し羨望を覚えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は控えめながら整ったプロポーションなのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地味さが先にたちほとんど気付かれていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛、そしてエッチにも興味はあるものの、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怖さの方が先に立ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"つい先日も、それが原因で初めて出来た彼氏にフラれてしまった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"111702"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd2158b4425ae86cb0ae67c625cf3f6b90eceb8065581d8df89d034d506a6775.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70024e4cbfc4c4576244d615d2e8edf61e8ab10d8f15eccf1c43f5223390a72f.webp","width":105,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"椿理沙","creatorId":"vndb:s3